/3568190606","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113067#issuecomment-3568190606","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113067","id":3568190606,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UrkSO","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T17:47:32Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T17:47:32Z","body":"> However, when I enable \"Prefer Wayland\", the embedded mode stops working entirely - the game window doesn't embed into the editor at all.\n\nYeah, that's expected, as embedded mode is not yet implemented on Wayland. So it might be some quirk on your window manager related to XWayland. Which window manager are you using?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568190606/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568365169","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113067#issue